{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんたーーん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、突然ですが今日は7/20"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたしの19歳のお誕生日です‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さあさあ、一緒に歌ってください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♫はっぴばーすでいとゅゆー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はっぴばーすでいとゅゆー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はっぴばーすでい たんたんー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はっぴばーすでいとゅゆー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーーいわーーい一緒に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌ってくれた方ありがとう(´･ω･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好き♡♡♡じゃないよww"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/20/8702670/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして乃木坂でのお祝い( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたしのケーキはミルクレープ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃくちゃ美味しくて幸せ‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆にはあたしが『よーーいドン！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってからなのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生ちゃんがケーキにフォークを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さすというフライングww"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさが変わりに生ちゃんを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかってくれました(´･ω･`)さんきゅ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてあたしが1口2口とどんどん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べてまだまだ皆には焦らして～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツンデレ爆発( •ㅈ• )♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして一気に『よーいドン！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たぶんたったの3分ぐらいで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なくなりました。流石乃木坂‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の19歳のお誕生日は去年よりも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの人に祝ってもらって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とってもとっても幸せです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして同時にママやパパにも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝する日です。いろんなことが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あってたくさんケンカもしたけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"元気な体に産んでくれてありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも迷惑かけるかも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しれないけどよろしくね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とってもとっても大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ子供って思っていたけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう19歳。きっとそんなこと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"考えてたらあっという間に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年取っちゃうんだろうなって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46に入ってとても色濃い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"18歳をすごして19歳となった今"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"19歳なんて実感とかあんまり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"分からないし、19歳になってみて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どう？と聞かれても答えられないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ一つ言えるのは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなとこで終わりたくなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっと自分自身も乃木坂自体も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大きくなっていきたいんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからはね、19歳の魅力を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もった斉藤優里。どんなふうな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"魅力なのか分からないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きらきらかがやいて見せるんだ‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんの心に届くように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんこれからもご迷惑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かけるかもしれませんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斉藤優里をこれからも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暖かく見守ってください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんからのお手紙やプレゼント"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どれもこれも大切にします‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんとは乃木坂46に入らなければ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"決して出会う事はなかったと思いますですが、乃木坂46に入って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなにもあたしを大切に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"してくれている人がたくさんいて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何事にも応援してくれてときには"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喝もいれてくれて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にかけがえのない存在です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんはあたしの宝物です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/20/8702670/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チョコの名前のところ『ゆった』に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なってたの(´;ω;`)ガーーーン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"}